\id JHN
\c 3
\v 16 For God so loved the world
that he gave his one and only Son, \f + \ft Footnote text. \f*
that everyone who believes in him shall not perish.
\p
\v 17 For God did not send his Son into the world to condemn the world,
but to save the world through him. \x + \xo 3:17 \xt Cross reference. \x*
